{"speciesId":45,"names":{"fr":"Rafflesia","es":"Vileplume","en":"Vileplume","ja":"ラフレシア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Flaps its broad flower petals to scatter its poisonous pollen. The flapping sound is very loud."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It has the world's largest petals. With every step, the petals shake out heavy clouds of toxic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The bud bursts into bloom with a bang. It then starts scattering allergenic, poi­ sonous pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"By shaking its big petals, it scat­ ters toxic pollen into the air, turning the air yellow."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"VILEPLUME’s toxic pollen triggers atrocious allergy attacks. That’s why it is advisable never to approach any attractive flowers in a jungle, however pretty they may be."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"VILEPLUME has the world’s largest petals. They are used to attract prey that are then doused with toxic spores. Once the prey are immobilized, this POKéMON catches and devours them."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"In seasons when it produces more pollen, the air around a VILEPLUME turns yellow with the powder as it walks. The pollen is highly toxic and causes paralysis."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. It fiendishly scatters allergy-causing pollen from its petals."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It has the world’s largest petals. With every step, the petals shake out heavy clouds of toxic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The bud bursts into bloom with a bang. It then starts scattering allergenic, poisonous pollen."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses pétales sont les plus grands du monde. Il marche en répandant un pollen extrêmement allergène."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses pétales sont les plus grands du monde. Il marche en répandant un pollen extrêmement allergène."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Plus ses pétales sont grands, plus ils contiennent de pollen toxique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuanto mayores son sus pétalos, más tóxico es su polen. Le pesa la cabeza y le cuesta mantenerla erguida."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"花びらが 大きいほど たくさん 花粉を 出すが 頭が 重たくて 疲れてしまうという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il possède des pétales énormes. À chaque pas, ils sèment d’épais nuages de pollen toxique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene los pétalos más grandes del mundo. Estos expulsan densas nubes de polen tóxico al caminar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has the world’s largest petals. With every step, the petals shake out heavy clouds of toxic pollen."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"世界一 大きな 花びらは 歩くたびに 揺れて 大量の 毒花粉を ばらまいている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le pollen toxique de Rafflesia déclenche d’affreuses réactions allergiques. C’est pourquoi il est conseillé de ne jamais s’approcher des jolies fleurs trouvées dans la jungle, même lorsqu’elles sont magnifiques."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El polen que contienen las esporas tóxicas de Vileplume causa unos ataques de alergia muy agudos. Por eso, no es aconsejable acercarse a ninguna flor selvática, por muy bonita que sea."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vileplume’s toxic pollen triggers atrocious allergy attacks. That’s why it is advisable never to approach any attractive flowers in a jungle, however pretty they may be."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"毒花粉は 酷い アレルギーを 起こす。 ジャングルで 美しい 花を みつけても うかつに 近寄らない ほうが いいよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Rafflesia dispose des plus grands pétales du monde. Il s’en sert pour attirer ses proies avant de les endormir avec ses spores toxiques. Ce Pokémon n’a plus alors qu’à attraper sa proie et à la manger."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vileplume tiene los mayores pétalos del mundo. Los usa para atraer a sus presas y llenarlas de esporas tóxicas. Una vez que ha inmovilizado a las víctimas, las atrapa y las devora."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vileplume has the world’s largest petals. They are used to attract prey that are then doused with toxic spores. Once the prey are immobilized, this Pokémon catches and devours them."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"世界一 大きな 花びらで 獲物を おびき寄せ 毒の 花粉を 浴びせかける。 動けなくなった 獲物を 捕まえて 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il fait un bruit terrible quand il secoue ses pétales pour disperser son pollen empoisonné."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sacude sus enormes pétalos para propagar polen venenoso, lo cual provoca un verdadero estruendo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Flaps its broad flower petals to scatter its poisonous pollen. The flapping sound is very loud."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"毒の 花粉を ふりまくために 大きな はなびらを 揺らすと ものすごい 音も 響き渡る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il fait un bruit terrible quand il secoue ses pétales pour disperser son pollen empoisonné."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sacude sus enormes pétalos para propagar polen venenoso, lo cual provoca un verdadero estruendo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Flaps its broad flower petals to scatter its poisonous pollen. The flapping sound is very loud."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"毒の 花粉を ふりまくために 大きな はなびらを 揺らすと ものすごい 音も 響き渡る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il possède les plus gros pétales au monde, qui sèment d’épais nuages de pollen toxique à chacun de ses pas."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Tiene los pétalos más grandes del mundo. Al caminar, de ellos se desprenden densas nubes de polen tóxico."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It has the world’s largest petals. With every step, the petals shake out heavy clouds of toxic pollen."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"世界一 大きな 花びらは 歩くたびに 揺れて 大量の 毒花粉を ばらまいてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Plus ses pétales sont grands, plus il produit de pollen toxique. Toutefois, le poids de sa tête le fatigue."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuanto mayores son sus pétalos, 